{"verse_key": "10:74", "surah": 10, "verse": 74, "text_uthmani": "ثُمَّ بَعَثْنَا مِنۢ بَعْدِهِۦ رُسُلًا إِلَىٰ قَوْمِهِمْ فَجَآءُوهُم بِٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ فَمَا كَانُوا۟ لِيُؤْمِنُوا۟ بِمَا كَذَّبُوا۟ بِهِۦ مِن قَبْلُ ۚ كَذَٰلِكَ نَطْبَعُ عَلَىٰ قُلُوبِ ٱلْمُعْتَدِينَ", "translation": "Then We sent after him messengers to their peoples, and they came to them with clear proofs. But they were not to believe in that which they had denied before.<sup foot_note=196456>1</sup> Thus We seal over the hearts of the transgressors.", "verse_from_ms": 1665420, "verse_to_ms": 1691260, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "ثُمَّ", "start_ms": 1665420, "end_ms": 1666930}, {"i": 1, "text": "بَعَثْنَا", "start_ms": 1666930, "end_ms": 1667950}, {"i": 2, "text": "مِنۢ", "start_ms": 1667950, "end_ms": 1668660}, {"i": 3, "text": "بَعْدِهِۦ", "start_ms": 1668660, "end_ms": 1669620}, {"i": 4, "text": "رُسُلًا", "start_ms": 1669620, "end_ms": 1670440}, {"i": 5, "text": "إِلَىٰ", "start_ms": 1670440, "end_ms": 1671000}, {"i": 6, "text": "قَوْمِهِمْ", "start_ms": 1671000, "end_ms": 1672120}, {"i": 7, "text": "فَجَآءُوهُم", "start_ms": 1672120, "end_ms": 1675770}, {"i": 8, "text": "بِٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ", "start_ms": 1675770, "end_ms": 1677340}, {"i": 9, "text": "فَمَا", "start_ms": 1677340, "end_ms": 1677920}, {"i": 10, "text": "كَانُوا۟", "start_ms": 1677920, "end_ms": 1678740}, {"i": 11, "text": "لِيُؤْمِنُوا۟", "start_ms": 1678740, "end_ms": 1679950}, {"i": 12, "text": "بِمَا", "start_ms": 1679950, "end_ms": 1680510}, {"i": 13, "text": "كَذَّبُوا۟", "start_ms": 1680510, "end_ms": 1681580}, {"i": 14, "text": "بِهِۦ", "start_ms": 1681580, "end_ms": 1682220}, {"i": 15, "text": "مِن", "start_ms": 1682220, "end_ms": 1683360}, {"i": 16, "text": "قَبْلُ", "start_ms": 1683360, "end_ms": 1684170}, {"i": 17, "text": "ۚ", "start_ms": 1684170, "end_ms": 1685700}, {"i": 18, "text": "كَذَٰلِكَ", "start_ms": 1685700, "end_ms": 1686560